%% Shows the full request path: ingress → FastAPI auth → LiteLLM router (with
%% cache-hit / cache-miss branch) → backend selection (Ollama on the Proxmox
%% host vs cloud provider) → response. The async scrape edge from Prometheus
%% is rendered separately because it is not part of the request path — it is
%% an out-of-band observation, and conflating the two is the most common
%% diagrammatic mistake on observability-aware services.
